          <text class="section-title">上门遛狗基础服务</text>
        </view>
        
        <view class="dog-size-list">
          <view class="dog-size-item">
            <view class="dog-size-info">
              <view class="dog-icon small"></view>
              <view class="dog-details">
                <text class="dog-type">小型犬</text>
                <text class="dog-condition">体重＜10kg或身高＜40cm</text>
              </view>
            </view>
            <text class="dog-duration">25分钟</text>
          </view>
          
          <view class="dog-size-item">
            <view class="dog-size-info">
              <view class="dog-icon medium"></view>
              <view class="dog-details">
                <text class="dog-type">中型犬</text>
                <text class="dog-condition">体重11~30kg或身高40~60cm</text>
              </view>
            </view>
            <text class="dog-duration">20分钟</text>
          </view>
          
          <view class="dog-size-item">
            <view class="dog-size-info">
              <view class="dog-icon large"></view>
              <view class="dog-details">
                <text class="dog-type">大型犬</text>
                <text class="dog-condition">体重＞30kg或身高＞60cm</text>
              </view>
            </view>
            <text class="dog-duration">15分钟</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        
        <view class="service-note">
          <text class="note-text">基础服务遛狗时长约为<text class="highlight">15~25分钟</text>，由喂养员视狗狗体型&爆冲程度决定具体时长。</text>
        </view>
      </view>

